.TH BETTERGUAC-ADMIN 8 "November 2026" "betterguac" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
betterguac-admin \- BetterGuac administration helper
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B betterguac-admin
.RB status
.br
.B betterguac-admin
.RB reset-password
.I username
.br
.B betterguac-admin
.RB setup
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B status
shows the BetterGuac services and the sign-in address.
.B reset-password
gives an account a new random password, prints it once and clears its
two-factor enrollment so the user enrolls again at the next sign-in.
.B setup
re-runs the install-time setup; it never overwrites existing settings or data.
.SH FILES
/etc/betterguac/guacamole.properties, /etc/betterguac/initial-admin.txt,
/etc/betterguac/keys, /etc/betterguac/sync.env
